            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Not for treadmills. The CPSC recall database lists no MaxKare treadmill or walking pad recall as of 14 October 2026. In June 2025 about 8,560 MaxKare electric blankets sold exclusively on Walmart.com were recalled for overheating and fire hazards, with a refund remedy. That recall concerns a different product made by a different contract manufacturer.",
          },
        },
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "Article",
